 width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r87.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為∠BAC　的角平分線。若<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r88.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r89.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝9，∠ABC＝90°，則　E　到<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r90.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離為何？［109.會考補考］<br><img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_image17.png\" width=\"124\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["5","6","<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r92.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r93.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"作<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r94.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r95.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於　F　點　∵<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r96.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為∠BAC　之平分線<br>∴設<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r97.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r98.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝x<br>又∠BDC＝90°　∴<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r99.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r100.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>得<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r101.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r102.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r103.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r104.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>即　9：（9＋x）＝x：10<br>x（x＋9）＝90<br>x<sup>2</sup>＋9x－90＝0<br>（x－6）（x＋15）＝0<br>x＝6　或　x＝－15（不合）<br>∴E　到<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r105.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r106.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6<br><img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_image18.png\" width=\"124\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考 補考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910211","s":"如圖所示，正五邊形　ABCDE　中，F　點為<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r108.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">中點，P、Q　兩點分別在<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r109.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r110.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上且不為頂點，若<img src=\"img/364ea6_y109-b_r111.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/364ea6_y